ered because of your  credit score because your parents taught  you that  and your parents were wrong  and that belief that you have prospered  because of your credit score is what's  holding you is what's messing you up  here because that belief is a lie you  you're believing a lie  okay no one is prospered  because of their credit score  the credit score is built on the fact  that you borrowed money  paid it back on time  and you grew your credit score why did  you do that so that you could borrow  money and pay it back on time so that  you grow your credit score why did you  do that so that you could borrow money  so that you could pay it back on  groundhog day and so yeah i mean this is  a dog chasing its freaking tail here  and you guys are just going in circles  and all you're doing is keeping the bank  open and not jenna open  and so jenna this is about what makes  you prosperous  and by the way your credit score is not  a measure of your prosperity it is not a  measure of your net worth it's not a  measure of your income as a matter of  fact it doesn't take any of those things  into consideration the only thing your  credit score takes into consideration  the algorithm that builds it is 100  based on how much you play kissy face  with debt  that's all it is  and so  you know the all of your fear all of  your hesitation is based on you  believing a lie and the lie is that  credit scores cause prosperity  and they do not they merely measure  how much you've been playing kissy face  with the bank  how much interaction you've had with  debt  they merely measure that and the only  thing they give you is the ability to  borrow again and more  which does not cause prosperity it  causes the opposite it causes prosperity  for the freaking bank  stop it pay off your stinking house  we did an episode uh on the fine print  all about this it's called the dirty  truth behind your credit score you can  check it out uh wherever you find your  podcast and we we did this dave we went  through and we talked to  uh someone at churchill and they  explained to us the manual underwritten  process we called apartments and found  out you can rent without a credit score  i've i just rented a car and i rented  hotels just this past week without a  credit score with a debit card and so  these things can be done but there's  this myth out there that i'm not going  to be able to move in my financial life  i can't breathe if i don't have that  good credit score to show everyone yeah  and it is mythology

